  "prefLabel": "Bea 507.08 Joint Projects",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bea 507.08 Joint Projects. Municipalities may apply jointly for HIM grant funding, as long as all applicant municipalities are HC designated.\n\nSource. #14043, eff 8-8-24",
